    {
      "id": "claim_53bdf822b7bb4a3480effb3b84d49177",
      "statement": "The in-process replica keeps a managed celld_ltx::Db per resident cell that captures committed WAL and uploads on demand, registered the instant a cell activates so the output gate can prove a fresh cell durable with no cold-start window.",
